desc: Gold Standard Overdrive (ChowCentaur port) by chmaha
tags: overdrive distortion guitar pedal circuit model wdf neural
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  A circuit model of a famous gold "transparent" overdrive pedal: a wave digital filter model of the
  input buffer, the gain stage with its two feed-forward paths and the germanium diode clipper (run
  at 2x oversampling), the treble control and the output level stage, each as in the original
  circuit. Gain, Treble and Level work like the pedal's three knobs. Traditional mode runs the
  circuit model; Neural mode runs the original plugin's five small recurrent networks trained on the
  circuit, switched by the Gain knob. Bypass is the footswitch, Mono sums the input to one channel.
  Ported from ChowCentaur by Jatin Chowdhury (Chowdhury DSP)
  https://github.com/jatinchowdhury18/KlonCentaur (BSD 3-Clause)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
